    "body": "## Description\n\nFix Qwen3.5 GatedDeltaNet initialization in Ascend images without FLA-NPU by loading the selected MindSpeed GDN operators for FSDP and Megatron. Update the A2/A3 MindSpeed, MegatronAdaptor, and TransformerEngineNPU source pins, cap PyArrow below 26 for the image's NumPy 1.26 runtime, and require Trackio >=0.35.0 to avoid resolver backtracking to an obsolete release.\n\n## Related Issue\n\nNo linked issue.\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [x] 🐛 Bug fix\n- [ ] ✨ New feature\n- [ ] 💥 Breaking change\n- [ ] 📝 Documentation update\n- [ ] ♻️ Refactoring\n- [ ] ⚡ Performance improvement\n- [ ] ✅ Test coverage improvement\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] I have read the [Contributing Guide](https://github.com/areal-project/community/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [ ] Pre-commit hooks pass (`pre-commit run --all-files`)\n- [x] Relevant tests pass; new tests added for new functionality\n- [ ] Documentation updated (if applicable; built with `./docs/build_all.sh`)\n- [ ] Branch is up to date with `main`\n- [x] Self-reviewed via the `review-pr` skill\n- [x] This PR was created by a coding agent via the `create-pr` skill\n- [ ] This PR is a breaking change\n\n**Breaking Change Details (if applicable):** Not applicable.\n\n## Additional Context\n\nTargets `ascend`; the head commit is directly based on the current upstream `ascend` tip.\n\nValidation: `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider tests/test_mindspeed_gdn_patch.py` passed all six tests. Whitespace checks passed. Read-only checks in an Ascend development container confirmed the three updated dependency revisions and successful FSDP/Megatron operator imports and bindings with FLA-NPU absent.\n\nRisk: the dependency pin updates affect broader runtime paths. Full pre-commit was not rerun during this review/publication, and no image rebuild, numerical training, or distributed qualification was performed during this review.\n",
